install_confirm_title=AoT Installer: Install
install_confirm_body=AoT will be installed in the current user's home directory. During this process, several software packages, including the nginx web server, will be installed via apt. Do you want to proceed with the installation?
influx_db_title=AoT Installer: Measurement Database
influx_ask_body=Do you want to install InfluxDB?\n\nIf you do not install InfluxDB now, you will need to manually enter the InfluxDB server address and credentials in the AoT Settings menu after installation.
