arch_detect_error=\nError: Could not detect the system architecture\n
influx_skip_confirm_body=You chose not to install InfluxDB. This is appropriate if you plan to use an external InfluxDB server. After installation, you must update the InfluxDB client settings in the AoT Settings menu, or data storage and retrieval will not work correctly. To install InfluxDB instead, choose Cancel and restart the installation.
influx_option_missing_error=\nError: No InfluxDB installation option was selected\n
abort_banner=\n****************************************\n** ERROR during AoT installation! **\n****************************************\n\nAoT may not have been installed correctly!\n\nTo see the full details of the problem, check the end of the setup log:\n%s/install/setup.log\n\nIf you encountered a problem during installation, please submit a bug report at:\nhttps://github.com/AoT-inc/AoT/issues\n\nPlease attach the relevant excerpt from the setup log located at:\n%s/install/setup.log\n
