completion_banner=\n***************************************\n** AoT installation is complete! **\n***************************************\n\nThe installation has finished, but that does not mean every setting has been configured.\nIf you run into any issues, check the log at:\n%s/install/setup.log\n\nOpen https://%s/ (or your device's IP address) in a web browser to reach the AoT homepage.\nCreate an administrator account and continue with setup.\n
